#: ../../../user/templates/windows/qubes-windows.rst:78
#: 167d0f7609c74ae7b3c8c19cc0edc17b
msgid ""
"Windows ISOs can be downloaded directly from Microsoft (e.g., `here <https://"
"www.microsoft.com/en-us/software-download/windows10ISO>`__ for Win10), or "
"selected and downloaded via the `Windows Media Creation Tool <https://go."
"microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=691209>`__. You should, however, regard the "
"downloaded image to be untrustworthy, since there is no reliable way to "
"check that the download was not somehow compromised (see the discussion in "
"issue `Simplify Qubes Windows Tools Installation for R4.1 #7240 <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/qubes-issues/issues/7240>`__)."
